      "reader": "ReadTs",
      "reader_semantics": "After the first '=' ReadTs scans columns through 132 and uses the first character 0,1,2,3 anywhere in the remainder, including comment text; 0=(0,0), 1=(1,0), 2=(0,1), 3=(1,1).",
      "post_read_validation": "Input1 Checkint-validates Outse(1:78) and OutseLn(1:78) globally, which exposes storage hazards for indices not assigned by a particular ReadTs call."
